=== Alembic Programmatic Migration Demo (CUBRID) ===

[1] Created isolated temp working directory
[2] Ensured table cookbook_alembic_demo does not exist
[3] Wrote env.py and script.py.mako
[4] Autogenerated migration revision
[5] Upgraded to head (table should now exist)
[6] Verified: cookbook_alembic_demo now exists in the DB
[7] Downgraded one revision (table should be dropped)
[8] Verified: cookbook_alembic_demo dropped after downgrade

--- CUBRID + Alembic notes ---
  * Migration impl: CubridImpl (registered automatically by sqlalchemy-cubrid).
  * transactional_ddl = True  -> ROLLBACK undoes uncommitted DDL
    (autocommit off, the pycubrid default); by default a failed upgrade rolls back.
  * No native SEQUENCE support  -> migrations use AUTO_INCREMENT.
  * Identifiers are lowercase-folded with a 254-char max.

For a real project layout (alembic.ini at repo root), see
https://github.com/cubrid-lab/sqlalchemy-cubrid/blob/main/docs/ALEMBIC.md
